WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.950
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.580
I got you!

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.690
This is the second time you've saved me.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.540
The first time you saved 
me was ten years ago.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.070
To be accurate, you didn't save 
me, but a girl named Miyu.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:26.810
Miyu, do you not have friends?

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.670
Why do you ask that?

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:34.150
Because you're always only playing with me.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.780
I have a friend right before my eyes.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:44.860
Don't you, Aoi?  You don't 
think of me as your friend?

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.040
That's not true!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.340
Phew.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:52.780
I was happy.  She was my first friend.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.000
She's a victim of the Lost Incident.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.470
And I'm the Ignis created from her.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:08.460
Due to the Light Ignis's computer 
virus, she's in a deep sleep.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.050
No way!

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:12.020
How surprising.

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:16.210
That there's a connection 
between Aqua and Blue Girl.

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:20.490
In that case, there's only 
one thing for me to do.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.100
Are you serious?

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.540
I'm always serious.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.200
Then I'll show no mercy.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:30.950
We'll compete in a PK Duel!

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:33.170
PK Duel?

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:35.250
Player Kill.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:41.510
The loser has their account erased and is 
forbidden from accessing LINK VRAINS ever again!

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.520
Do you have the courage for this fight?

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:48.750
Interesting.  I'll take you on in a PK Duel.

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.020
Here I go, brother.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:14.360
Our lives aren't forever

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:21.150
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:28.470
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:35.040
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:41.790
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:49.020
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:55.730
I want to share your pain

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.790
Speed Duel!

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.870
I'll go first.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:34.330
I summon Drone Corporal from my hand!

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:41.630
I set one card and end my turn.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:45.100
I didn't know until then.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:46.950
Move, Emma!

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:55.140
He called me Emma...

00:03:56.760 --> 00:04:01.890
What you said intrigued me, so 
I studied everything about you.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:06.090
And I learned Blood Shepherd's identity.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:10.070
You're Kengo Dojun, my half-brother.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:13.060
I also learned about the car accident.

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:16.800
But that's no reason to hate the Ignis.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:21.070
Be quiet!  You were raised in a nice 
home, so you don't know anything!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:28.340
My father-  No, that man selfishly 
chose work over me and my mother.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:33.220
He succeeded in his work and 
gained tremendous wealth.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:35.850
But he didn't return to us.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:43.590
The next time I saw him, 
he was already your father.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:51.600
There's no way you know how I felt!

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.670
But Dad was-

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:56.440
We're done talking!  Continue the duel.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.910
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:04.400
From my hand, I activate the trap 
card, Infinite Impermanence!

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.020
When there are no cards on my field...

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:12.420
...one of your monsters' effects are 
negated until the end of the turn!

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.390
I select Drone Corporal!

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.130
Drone Corporal's effect activates!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:23.370
When it's the target of a card 
effect, that effect is negated!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:30.930
But since I activated a trap, I can Special 
Summon Altergeist Multifaker from my hand!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.310
So that's what you were aiming for.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:37.650
When Multifaker is Special Summoned...

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:42.880
...I Special Summon Altergeist Meluseek 
from my deck in defense position!

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:47.530
Then I summon Altergeist 
Marionetter from my hand!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.230
When Marionetter is summoned...

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:56.880
...I can set the trap card, Altergeist 
Haunted Rock from my deck!

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:01.710
I don't see the point of 
revealing what my trap is.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.980
Because you can activate 
it on the turn it's set.

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:06.600
Exactly.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:09.920
Altergeist Haunted Rock activates!

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:13.700
I send one Altergeist in 
my hand to the graveyard!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:19.520
Open before me!  The circuit that connects 
to the unknown parallel universe!

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:25.240
I set Multifaker and Meluseek 
in the Link Markers!

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:26.900
Link Summon!

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:31.910
Appear, Link 2 Altergeist Hexstia!

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:41.110
Since Altergeist Meluseek was sent to 
the graveyard, its effect activates!

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:44.850
I add one Altergeist in my deck to my hand.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:53.410
Due to Hexstia's effect, it gains the 
original ATK of the Altergeist next to its link!

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:55.960
I'm not done!

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:58.430
Marionetter's effect activates!

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:03.130
By sending an Altergeist on 
my field to the graveyard...

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:07.740
...I Special Summon an Altergeist from 
my graveyard in defense position!

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:11.610
Resurrect, Altergeist Fifinellag!

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:19.450
Level 2 Fifinellag tunes Level 4 Marionetter!

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.760
The legendary evil spirit!

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:35.270
Surpass eternal time and show yourself!

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:38.470
This is...

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.170
Synchro Summon!

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.650
Appear, Level 6!

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:49.770
Altergeist Dragvirion!

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:56.350
Since the monster next to Hexstia's 
link changed, it gains ATK!

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:01.390
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Capture Drone!

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:09.130
When there's a Drone on my field, your Link 
Monster's attack and effects are negated.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.500
Hexstia's effect!

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:18.210
When a spell or trap card's effect activates, 
by tributing an Altergeist next to its link...

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:21.650
...Capture Drone's activation 
is negated and destroyed!

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:29.150
The monster next to Hexstia's link 
is gone, so its ATK return to normal.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:35.160
You lost the Synchro Summoned Dragvirion, 
and Hexstia's ATK greatly decreased.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.740
That was too high a price to pay.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.350
Calm down.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.630
My turn isn't over yet.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.610
Dragvirion's effect activates!

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:52.110
When it's tributed and sent to the 
graveyard, it's Special Summoned again!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:59.350
Since it returned next to Hexstia's 
link, it returns to 3700 ATK!

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:02.800
See?  Back to how it was.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:05.360
You wasted a trap card.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:11.070
Battle!  Dragvirion attacks Drone Corporal!

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:19.940
He no longer has monsters 
or set cards on his field.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:23.680
If Hexstia's attack gets through, I can win!

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:25.140
This is the end!

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:30.220
Altergeist Hexstia attacks you directly!

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:35.050
I activate Drone Asteroid's 
effect from my hand!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:41.460
When you attack me directly, it sends itself 
to the graveyard and negates your attack!

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:48.500
Then I Special Summon a Drone Token 
for every monster on your field.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:55.290
I knew you wouldn't let me win easily.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.450
I end my turn.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.680
And it'll be your last turn.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.570
I'll win next turn.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.360
On count one.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.090
Hey, look at this!

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:14.030
LINK VRAINS's surveillance 
footage 30 minutes ago.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:18.800
That's Blue Girl and Blood Shepherd!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.440
That's not all.

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:25.070
It's Aqua!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:27.560
Why is the Ignis with Blue Girl?

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.840
I don't know.

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:31.450
But Aqua is definitely in trouble.

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:34.810
If we don't hurry, that 
gunman will capture her!

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:39.690
Deck set!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.030
Into the VRAINS!

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.770
Miyu...

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:07.170
She's a victim of the Lost Incident.

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:10.980
And she still hasn't regained consciousness.

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:17.200
While she was imprisoned, 
you kept her strong, Aoi.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:23.130
No matter how many duels she 
lost, no matter how painful...

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:26.430
Even when she was hungry 
after reducing her meals...

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:30.400
She never broke and promised to escape.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:34.600
So she could see you again 
and apologize for that day.

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:36.740
She did her best.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.540
Miyu...

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:42.560
You changed her.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:43.460
You're wrong!

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:45.580
She changed me!

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:51.590
After losing my parents, I only 
had my brother in my world.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:56.590
I closed the door to my 
heart and hid deep inside.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:03.840
But Miyu, with that carefree smile, 
opened the door to my heart.

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:07.560
She wanted to apologize to me?

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.270
When I'm thankful for her?

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:14.330
You gave her courage.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:19.880
And she passed that courage on 
to me.  To stop the Light Ignis.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:24.620
But to do that, I need your strength.

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.780
My strength...

00:12:27.340 --> 00:12:29.960
Will you fight with me?

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:36.320
My turn.  I draw!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:40.720
I summon Drone Carrier from my hand!

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:45.180
Come out!  The circuit that leads to victory!

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:48.810
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Drones.

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:53.790
I set Drone Carrier and two Drone 
Tokens in the Link Markers!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.720
Link Summon.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:02.190
Deploy!  Link 3 Battledrone General!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:06.860
Battledrone General's effect activates!

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:12.040
It Special Summons a Drone in 
my graveyard next to its link.

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:15.040
I select Drone Carrier!

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:23.380
When it's Special Summoned, I can Special 
Summon another Drone from my graveyard!

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:26.120
Come, Drone Corporal!

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:32.460
Battledrone General's effect activates!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:39.700
My Level 4 or lower Drone with 1000 
or less ATK can attack you directly!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:42.930
I select Drone Carrier!

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:47.680
If the direct attack succeeds, 
due to General's effect...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:52.440
...I can tribute that monster to 
deal you damage equal to its ATK!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.410
Drone Carrier will attack directly.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:14:00.790
Battle!  Drone Corporal attacks you directly!

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.390
What?  Not Carrier?

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:07.860
Drone Corporal's effect lets 
it attack you directly.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.860
But the battle damage is halved.

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:13.600
Either way, it's 800 damage.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:20.840
But due to General's effect, I tribute the 
attacking Drone to deal you damage equal to its ATK!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:24.080
So the tribute damage increases?

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:26.580
Well, I'm fine either way.

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:28.950
Kunquery's effect activates!

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:31.740
When your monster attacks...

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:36.540
...it Special Summons itself from my 
hand and negates Corporal's attack!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:44.460
When Kunquery is Special Summoned, it 
negates one of your monsters' effects!

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:48.300
I, of course, select Battledrone General!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:52.870
Now Drone Carrier can't attack me directly.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.870
Who said I was attacking you directly?

00:14:57.020 --> 00:15:00.350
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Drone Force Tuning!

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:09.490
Drones that didn't deal battle damage 
this turn can be used to Synchro Summon.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:13.130
You're planning to Synchro 
Summon during battle.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:15.160
But I won't let you!

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:17.630
Hexstia's effect activates!

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:24.640
When a spell or trap's effect activates, by 
tributing an Altergeist next to its link...

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:28.410
...Drone Force Tuning's activation 
is negated and destroyed!

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:33.070
Too bad.  Drone Force Tuning's activation 
and effect can't be negated.

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:38.880
Hexstia no longer has a monster next to 
its link, so its ATK return to normal.

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:44.190
The tributed Dragvirion's effect activates!

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:47.290
It's Special Summoned 
again from my graveyard!

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:54.270
And due to Hexstia's effect, 
its ATK increase again!

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:56.220
I'm only getting started.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.320
It's over for you.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:03.640
Level 2 Carrier tunes Level 4 Corporal!

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.340
The elite sharpshooter with no equal.

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:13.550
Fire your bullet at your prey!

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:19.560
Synchro Summon.

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:24.030
Level 6 Commandrone Double Sniper!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:28.270
Battle!  General attacks Dragvirion!

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:36.120
If Dragvirion is destroyed, 
Hexstia will lose a lot of ATK.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:38.280
But I won't let that happen!

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:41.010
Dragvirion's effect activates!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:43.080
When your monster attacks...

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:49.160
...I negate that attack by returning 
an Altergeist on my field to my hand!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:17:01.770
Since Kunquery returned to my hand, the 
effect on Battledrone General ends.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.630
So that's your move.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.270
Thank you.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.650
Due to Double Sniper's effect...

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:13.010
...when an effect that negates a monster's
 attack or card activation activates,

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:15.080
I place one Drone Counter.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:19.160
Then I activate my Skill!

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.920
Drone Craft Force!

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:22.390
A Skill?

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:26.800
Until the end of the turn, 
one of your monsters loses

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:30.400
200 ATK for every Drone in my graveyard.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:37.670
And a Drone Link Monster 
on my field gains that ATK!

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:41.910
Blood Shepherd has five Drone 
cards in his graveyard.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.870
Down 1000 ATK.

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:51.550
And General gains 1000 ATK.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.850
Double Sniper attacks Dragvirion!

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.700
Kunquery's effect activates!

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:06.700
When your monster attacks, I Special Summon 
this monster from my hand in defense position!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:10.170
And your attack is negated!

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:13.400
That lets me place one Drone Counter.

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:20.740
Since Kunquery was Special Summoned, 
General's effects are negated again-

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:22.110
I don't think so!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.340
When Double Sniper has two counters...

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:29.660
...your monster's effect 
is negated and destroyed!

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:31.820
And you take 1000 damage!

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:36.740
When it has one or more counters...

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:41.770
...Double Sniper can attack 
twice, and attack you directly!

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:45.510
But the direct attack's damage becomes 1000.

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:49.470
Double Sniper attacks you directly!

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:56.310
General's effect activates!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:01.720
When it deals you direct damage, 
by tributing that monster...

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:06.220
...you take damage equal to its 2000 ATK!

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:15.680
I lost.  I couldn't protect them.

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:20.870
Starting today, no more Ghost Girl.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:29.580
Fine.  As promised, erase my account.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:35.820
But let me say one thing in the end!

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:37.290
What is it?

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:41.390
Dad died last year due to illness.

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.850
I know.

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:45.230
Until the moment he died...

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:53.260
Emma, if Kengo ever needs help, help him.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.420
Dad...

00:19:56.910 --> 00:20:00.120
He was always worried about you.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:03.890
That's all I wanted to say!  Now do it!

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:22.910
Hey!

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:28.100
Where's Blood Shepherd?

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.840
He left.

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:32.410
You're not with Blue Girl?

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:34.180
What happened to Aqua?

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:36.210
Aqua and I are both here.

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:40.850
Aqua!

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:43.590
Long time no see, Dark Ignis.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.560
Oh, I'm called Ai in this world.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:49.770
And I'm Flame, which means ind-

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.360
Why are you in Blue Girl's Duel Disk?

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.830
Will you fight with me?

00:20:56.720 --> 00:21:00.990
Miyu endured painful days 
so she could meet me.

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:03.070
It's time for me to try hard!

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:06.680
I'll fight with you!

